+## Registration design decision
 
-Use only permission-cleared portfolio images and genuine reviews with publication consent.
+Email remains required because WooCommerce needs a stable login/recovery and order-notification identifier. The installer enables generated username and generated password, so the visible registration remains short: first name, last name, email, and optional phone. Postal address and city appear only when a physical order requires shipping, not during profile creation.
 
-## Validation
+## Tests
